WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.258 --> 00:00:02.164
- Eat the meat jello.

00:00:02.164 --> 00:00:03.910
Eat the meat jello.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:05.481
Eat the meat jello.

00:00:05.481 --> 00:00:06.314
Eat--

00:00:06.314 --> 00:00:09.231
(Russian folk music)

00:00:09.231 --> 00:00:11.271
- So, I wasn't planning
on making this video,

00:00:11.271 --> 00:00:12.982
but the other day I was
shooting with my mom,

00:00:12.982 --> 00:00:15.385
and just like any typical
Jewish-Russian mom,

00:00:15.385 --> 00:00:17.294
all she could focus on was feeding me.

00:00:17.294 --> 00:00:18.939
So, she brought me Holodets,

00:00:18.939 --> 00:00:20.987
which is a traditional Russian dish.

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:24.105
It's just meat engulfed in its own fat.

00:00:24.105 --> 00:00:24.938
She loves it.

00:00:24.938 --> 00:00:26.687
I don't know why; I hate it.

00:00:26.687 --> 00:00:27.792
This is what happened.

00:00:27.792 --> 00:00:28.734
Mom, I'm not having it.
- There.

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:29.567
- Mom, no, no.
- There.

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:30.497
- No means no, okay?
- There; there.

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:32.794
- Mom, no, I'm not having it.
- There.

00:00:32.794 --> 00:00:34.277
- Just try it; if you don't
like it, you can spit it out.

00:00:34.277 --> 00:00:35.277
Just try it.

00:00:37.714 --> 00:00:38.547
- [Female Voice] Chew, Eric.

00:00:38.547 --> 00:00:39.380
- You know what?

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.121
You should let your friends
in the office try it.

00:00:41.121 --> 00:00:42.755
Because I know that
everybody's gonna like it.

00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:43.588
You'd be nuts.

00:00:43.588 --> 00:00:44.421
- Oh, you think everybody's gonna like it?

00:00:44.421 --> 00:00:45.920
- Yes, I think so.
- Okay, you wanna make a bet?

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:46.753
- Well--

00:00:46.753 --> 00:00:47.740
- All right, what are we betting?

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:50.999
- We'll bet that if they
like it, you eat it.

00:00:50.999 --> 00:00:52.023
- Oh, if they like it, I eat it, okay.

00:00:52.023 --> 00:00:52.856
- Yeah, you eat the whole thing.

00:00:52.856 --> 00:00:53.689
- And if they don't like it?

00:00:53.689 --> 00:00:55.991
- And if they don't like it, I'll eat it.

00:00:55.991 --> 00:00:56.891
- (snorts) What?

00:00:56.891 --> 00:00:57.761
You like it.

00:00:57.761 --> 00:00:58.880
No, if they don't like it,

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.214
I never have to eat this ever again.

00:01:00.214 --> 00:01:02.245
- That's fine, agreed.

00:01:02.245 --> 00:01:06.038
(Russian folk music)

00:01:06.038 --> 00:01:07.487
Hi.

00:01:07.487 --> 00:01:08.515
- Oh my god, hello.

00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:09.733
- Hi, I'm Eric's mom.

00:01:09.733 --> 00:01:11.242
- Oh my god.

00:01:11.242 --> 00:01:12.075
- Hi, I've heard so much about you.

00:01:12.075 --> 00:01:13.771
- I brought in a little lunch.

00:01:13.771 --> 00:01:14.627
Excuse me.

00:01:14.627 --> 00:01:16.576
Hi, sorry to bother you.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:20.480
I'm Eric's mom, and we made
a little bet with Eric.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.313
I brought him lunch.

00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:22.984
- Eric, are you serious?

00:01:22.984 --> 00:01:24.961
You're seriously bringing
your mom into this?

00:01:24.961 --> 00:01:25.794
- Is this a big bite?

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:26.627
Is this too much?

00:01:26.627 --> 00:01:27.477
- [Mom] This is perfect.

00:01:27.477 --> 00:01:28.934
- This is a good-sized bite.
- It's a really good bite.

00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:30.517
- To Eric's family.

00:01:31.952 --> 00:01:32.785
Uh-hmmm.

00:01:35.768 --> 00:01:39.269
- [Mom] You have to get used to it.

00:01:39.269 --> 00:01:41.766
- Thank you so much.

00:01:41.766 --> 00:01:42.599
- Good?

00:01:43.543 --> 00:01:44.376
- Achoo.

00:01:45.274 --> 00:01:46.691
- Not bad, right?

00:01:48.761 --> 00:01:49.727
- Huh-uh.

00:01:49.727 --> 00:01:50.560
- What do you think?

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:54.488
- It literally just tastes
like chicken and jello.

00:01:54.488 --> 00:01:55.887
- [Mom] Yeah, you like it?

00:01:55.887 --> 00:01:57.723
- It tastes like chicken and jello.

00:01:57.723 --> 00:01:59.750
- We eat it with horseradish and bread.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.731
So can I put a little horseradish,
and you'll give it a try?

00:02:01.731 --> 00:02:02.970
- I honestly think that would help.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.220
- Yes, okay, let me get it.

00:02:07.204 --> 00:02:10.234
- Buddy, I need to get out of here.

00:02:10.234 --> 00:02:12.371
- This is made out of chicken fat.

00:02:12.371 --> 00:02:14.177
Like, I don't think this is real jello

00:02:14.177 --> 00:02:15.162
that you get in the store.

00:02:15.162 --> 00:02:17.808
I don't taste the strawberry, the cherry.

00:02:17.808 --> 00:02:21.391
- Texturally, I thought
I was about to die.

00:02:23.241 --> 00:02:25.223
- Wait until you try it with horseradish.

00:02:25.223 --> 00:02:26.742
This is for you dissolve it.

00:02:26.742 --> 00:02:28.502
And like this.

00:02:28.502 --> 00:02:29.335
Okay?

00:02:29.335 --> 00:02:30.947
And you take a piece of black bread.

00:02:30.947 --> 00:02:31.780
- Black bread?

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:32.613
- Black bread.

00:02:32.613 --> 00:02:33.446
- This is black bread.

00:02:33.446 --> 00:02:34.693
Is it whole wheat or anything?

00:02:34.693 --> 00:02:36.088
- It's made out of black something.

00:02:36.088 --> 00:02:37.474
I'm not exactly sure.

00:02:37.474 --> 00:02:38.307
- Got it.

00:02:38.307 --> 00:02:39.404
- So first that.
- First this.

00:02:39.404 --> 00:02:40.452
- [Both] And then that.

00:02:40.452 --> 00:02:41.285
- Gotcha.

00:02:41.285 --> 00:02:46.245
- Second time. (surprised whimper)

00:02:46.245 --> 00:02:48.917
- (groan of disgust)
I mean, this is great.

00:02:48.917 --> 00:02:49.750
- Good, right?

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:50.583
- Did you make this yourself?

00:02:50.583 --> 00:02:51.441
- Yes.

00:02:51.441 --> 00:02:54.017
(chuckles)

00:02:54.017 --> 00:02:54.850
- Yeah, I get it.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.483
- This is literally just horseradish.

00:02:56.483 --> 00:02:57.734
- Horseradish definitely helps.

00:02:57.734 --> 00:02:59.772
- Yes, yes, you know what would help?

00:02:59.772 --> 00:03:00.724
Vodka.

00:03:00.724 --> 00:03:01.557
- Vodka?

00:03:01.557 --> 00:03:02.617
- Yes.

00:03:02.617 --> 00:03:05.942
- I thought I just ate a shot of vodka.

00:03:05.942 --> 00:03:08.395
- This afternoon has
gone from zero to 100.

00:03:08.395 --> 00:03:12.062
Oh, this is your typical
Russian shot glass?

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:17.173
- So, the bet is that if you like it,

00:03:17.173 --> 00:03:18.990
Eric is gonna eat the whole thing.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:20.469
- Oh well, I love it.

00:03:20.469 --> 00:03:22.526
- Yeah, this is really good.

00:03:22.526 --> 00:03:23.359
- I love it, Eric.

00:03:23.359 --> 00:03:24.440
Now you have to eat some.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:26.025
- So, did you guys like it?

00:03:26.025 --> 00:03:28.771
(all exclaim in agreement)

00:03:28.771 --> 00:03:30.013
- [Coworker] It was delicious.

00:03:30.013 --> 00:03:32.281
(all chatter in agreement)

00:03:32.281 --> 00:03:33.114
- [Coworker] That bread?

00:03:33.114 --> 00:03:34.020
To die for.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.858
- Eat the meat.

00:03:35.858 --> 00:03:37.750
Eat the meat jello.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.340
Eat the meat jello.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:40.918
Eat the meat jello.

00:03:40.918 --> 00:03:42.429
Eat the meat jello.

00:03:42.429 --> 00:03:43.754
Eat the meat jello.

00:03:43.754 --> 00:03:45.020
Eat the meat jello.

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:48.020
(Coworkers chatter)

00:03:49.004 --> 00:03:51.504
- Why is there vodka in there?

00:03:56.021 --> 00:03:57.503
(all exclaim in disgust)

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:59.001
- Oh, come on, you've got to be strong.

00:03:59.001 --> 00:04:00.577
- You still have to eat it all.

00:04:00.577 --> 00:04:01.752
- I'm done; I'm done.

00:04:01.752 --> 00:04:03.249
No, I'm quitting.

00:04:03.249 --> 00:04:04.082
- [Coworker] Your food's delicious.

00:04:04.082 --> 00:04:05.516
You're son's a piece of (bleep).

00:04:05.516 --> 00:04:07.849
(all laugh)

